  "title": "Gluten-Free Beer Bread",
  "description": "You&#39;ll need gluten-free beer and a gluten-free flour mix to make this tasty beer bread sweetened with agave nectar. It&#39;s a great sandwich bread!",
  "authors": [
    "sdewing"
  ],
